{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1082", "sample_idx": 23, "model_name": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b", "content": "He opened his eyes to the familiar ceiling of his bedroom, but the world felt oddly pixelated, as if a low‑resolution filter had been slapped over reality. A faint health bar hovered in the corner of his vision, and when he reached for his phone, the icons glowed with a soft neon outline, responding to his thoughts before his fingers could touch them. The sound of his own breath was accompanied by a subtle 8‑bit chime, and a small quest log appeared, flashing “Tutorial: Learn the Controls” in a font straight out of a retro arcade. He laughed nervously, convinced he was still dreaming, until the timer on the screen began counting down from ten, urging him to move.\n\n***\nHe swung his legs out of bed, feeling the weight of his avatar’s armor clank against the floor, and realized the game’s physics were oddly forgiving—his jumps were higher, his falls softer, and every obstacle seemed designed to be overcome with a simple pattern. With a grin, he embraced the role, sprinting toward the glowing doorway that marked the first level’s exit, knowing that each step would earn him experience points, unlock new abilities, and perhaps, if he played his cards right, reveal the secret to logging out—or at least to beating the final boss.", "logprobs": [{"token": "We", "logprob": -0.029708990827202797}, {"token": " need", "logprob": -0.004763801582157612}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -0.35861271619796753}, {"token": " write", "logprob": -0.5537695288658142}, {"token": " exactly", "logprob": -0.7083519101142883}, {"token": " ", "logprob": -0.02978929691016674}, {"token": "2", "logprob": -5.960462772236497e-07}, {"token": " paragraphs", "logprob": -1.9073468138230965e-06}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.6107718348503113}, {"token": " separated", "logprob": -0.007587542291730642}, {"token": " by", "logprob": -0.0052475095726549625}, {"token": " markdown", "logpro